# BASKET DATA INTEGRITY SPRINT
# Date: 2026-04-02
# Input: _project/audits/BASKET_AUDIT.md + _project/audits/BASKET_SPECIFICATIONS.md
# Target: Professional basket with correct data flow, type safety, hydration, and test coverage
# Scope: Structure, data pass, state management, user flow, robustness, testing
# Out of scope: Styling, layout, interactivity polish, payments/checkout internals

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LESSONS APPLIED (from _project/lessons/INDEX.md)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# [Critical] type-consolidation: Single source of truth for types at data layer
# [Critical] sequencing: Pass 1→2→3 enforcement, no mixing
# [Critical] verification-gates: Data verification before hypothesis
# [High] functional-grouping: Complete functional groups, not isolated components
# [High] velocity-aware-sprint-planning: Compressed scope, verifiable DoD, no re-planning during execution
# [High] field-consistency: Frontend/backend field naming must match (price vs displayPrice)
# [High] baseline: Verify baseline before sprint work

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SCOPE LOCK RULES (MANDATORY — what NOT to touch)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ✗ NO globals.css changes
# ✗ NO homepage component changes
# ✗ NO Sanity schema changes
# ✗ NO Tailwind config changes
# ✗ NO checkout/payment internals (Stripe, webhook, order creation)
# ✗ NO styling/layout changes (existing Tailwind classes preserved unless broken)
# ✗ NO new dependencies (zustand already installed, vitest already installed)
# ✗ NO build runs except at sprint end (use dev server for verification)
# ✗ NO modifications outside listed files per scope contract

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRE-SPRINT BASELINE (MANDATORY)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Action: Verify dev server starts without error
# Command: npx next dev (confirm no crash on basket-related pages)
# Action: Verify no existing basket tests to regress
# Status: Archived tests are 100% commented out — no active test baseline

