# Gap Coverage: G-05, G-07, G-10, G-15
# Files: app/(store)/basket/basket.types.ts, store/store.ts
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Target State:
#   BasketItem includes slug field. Store exports selector functions
#   (selectBasketTotal, selectBasketCount, selectIsCheckoutEnabled,
#   selectHasHydrated) instead of getTotal/isCheckoutEnabled methods.
#   Persist config has version:1, migrate function (price→displayPrice),
#   onRehydrateStorage validates item shape and sets _hasHydrated=true.
#   Console.log removed from rehydration.
#
# DoD:
☐ Add slug:string to BasketItem interface @basket.types.ts
☐ Remove getTotal and isCheckoutEnabled as store methods @store.ts
☐ Export selectBasketTotal, selectBasketCount, selectIsCheckoutEnabled, selectHasHydrated as selector functions @store.ts
☐ Fix onRehydrateStorage: validate item shapes + set _hasHydrated=true @store.ts
☐ Add version:1 and migrate function (price→displayPrice, add slug fallback) to persist config @store.ts
☐ Remove console.log from onRehydrateStorage @store.ts
