#   increments by item.quantity (not always 1), clamped to stock.
#   When new, uses Math.min(item.quantity, item.stock).
#   Updates existing item's stock value from caller.
#   Validates slug and image fields as required.
#
# DoD:
☐ Fix addItem: new items use Math.min(item.quantity, item.stock) not Math.min(1, item.stock) @store.ts
☐ Fix addItem: existing items increment by item.quantity, clamped to stock @store.ts
☐ Fix addItem: update existing item's stock from caller data @store.ts
☐ Fix addItem: add slug and image to input validation @store.ts
